point of wisdom, an extra point of dexterity, and a point of constitution.
Mind you I'm not complaining, but I was wondering if anyone else has had
this happen?  I was not wearing anything special or anything like that.
However I had found an uncursed luckstone.  When I died(a damn monster picked up
a wand of fire and zapped me) I has lucky, had extra luck, and good/bad luck did
not time out for me.  Also I was devoutly aligned.  I wonder if this has to do with
my good luck, or my happy god?
